Usage: ai-cockpit finish [OPTIONS] --repo <REPO> --id <ID>

Options:
      --repo <REPO>          
      --id <ID>              
      --json                 Emit machine-only output without the human Outcome handoff on stderr
      --language <LANGUAGE>  Conversation language for the human Outcome; when omitted the adapter locale/environment is used [possible values: en, zh, zh-CN, ja]
  -h, --help                 Print help
